  "title": "Google's AI-Driven App Launches and Expansion",
  "summary": "Google is making it easier to build and use personal AI-generated apps across Android devices, with new features like a Play Store where apps can be launched directly without needing a computer. The company also expands its Pixel and Watch 5 series with AI-powered features.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Google has introduced a new feature allowing users to launch their own AI-generated apps directly through the Play Store.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Play Store now adapts to the size of a car's screen and makes it easier to find and download apps.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Google plans to expand its AI-powered Pixel and Watch 5 series with new features.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
